        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-807, Ornate Curved Drop Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in a 3 inch center to center or a 5 inch center to center, the Barrel Middle Cabinet Pull is simple yet beautiful in its quaint traditional style. The beaded center is a classic shape among door hardware, and for good reason. Classic designs are beautiful in their timelessness, never seeming outdated, only quietly chic. This RK international cabinet door pull is available in 6 finishes including oil rubbed bronze and satin nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/barrel-middle-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4621\"><b>Barrel Middle Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-807 Ornate Swirl Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-807</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>CP-808</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
